            <fullName>Prep_Renewal_Brief_179g5000001Z7xJ</fullName>
            <description>Use whenever the user names a specific account and asks to prep, prepare, brief, or get detail on it for renewal, OR asks for customer outreach, an email, or a message to send to that customer about their renewal. Retrieves the full renewal picture for one named account in the account executive&apos;s own book and produces either an internal renewal brief or a customer-facing email draft. Requires the account name as a search term.</description>
