        </localActions>
        <localActions>
            <fullName>Get_My_Renewals_179g5000001Z7xJ</fullName>
            <description>Returns the contract renewals assigned to the account executive who is using the agent, ordered by soonest expiry, with a short risk summary for each. Use when the user asks which of their renewals need attention, what is in their book of business, which contracts are coming up for renewal, or what is expiring soon. Takes no inputs — the account executive is identified automatically from the logged-in user. This action cannot retrieve another person&apos;s renewals and cannot be narrowed to a single account. This action returns the whole list only. It cannot prepare, brief, or give detail on a single named account — use the renewal brief action for that.</description>
            <developerName>Get_My_Renewals_179g5000001Z7xJ</developerName>
